local P,j="LibStub",2 local Y=_G[P]if not Y or Y.minor<j then Y=Y or{libs={},minors={}}_G[P]=Y Y.minor=j function Y.NewLibrary(Y,P,j)assert(type(P)=="string","Bad argument #2 to `NewLibrary\' (string expected)")j=assert(tonumber(strmatch(j,"%d+")),"Minor version must either be a number or contain a number.")local X=Y.minors[P]if X and X>=j then return nil end Y.minors[P],Y.libs[P]=j,Y.libs[P]or{}return Y.libs[P],X end function Y.GetLibrary(Y,P,j)if not Y.libs[P]and not j then error((("Cannot find a library instance of %q.")):format(tostring(P)),2)end return Y.libs[P],Y.minors[P]end function Y.IterateLibraries(P)return pairs(P.libs)end setmetatable(Y,{__call=Y.GetLibrary})end